// title: MailItemsAccessed Defense
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Cloud Apps
// tables: CloudAppEvents
// purpose: MailItemsAccessed Defense
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/MailItemsAccessed%20Defense.kql
// kind: repo
// author: Steven Lim
